  slide "SteppableEngine: the direct single-worker wrapper" {
    eyebrow: "4 · Single-worker"
    title: "No router, no event heap — every step is just one scheduler pass"
    lede: "SteppableEngine wraps exactly one ReplayWorkerCore. next_event_ms has no heap to query: it returns Some(now_ms) while the worker holds any request, None when empty. step_until therefore inherits the trait's default and rejects any finite deadline — a single already-executing scheduler pass cannot be interrupted mid-flight."
    narration: "The single-worker engine is the simplest of the three. It has one worker, one collector, and its own current-time field. Submit stamps the arrival at the current time and hands the request to the worker. Step calls the worker's execute pass, walks the output signals, classifies each into an engine event, and advances the clock to the pass's end time. Because there's no event heap to consult, the next-event query can only say now or nothing — so it cannot honor a finite step-until deadline, and calling it with one is an error."
    term: {
      word: "execute_pass"
      meaning: "ReplayWorkerCore's scheduler tick: runs one batching/decoding pass at the current time and returns output_signals — the per-request token/completion facts SteppableEngine turns into EngineEvents."
    }
    points: [
      "SteppableEngine::new declares static_worker_count(0, 1) and gpus_per_worker up front — mirrors offline/single.rs so finish() can derive decode_worker_seconds and gpu_hours.",
      "submit(): worker.receive(req) then collector.on_arrival(uuid, now_ms, input_length, output_length).",
      "step(): worker.execute_pass(&mut collector, now_ms) → classify signals → collector.on_terminal for completions → now_ms = pass.end_ms.",
      "step_until(finite) -> Err: \"cannot stop at finite deadline\" — verified by direct_single_worker_rejects_finite_step_deadline."
    ]
    caption: "one ReplayWorkerCore, one collector, no heap — step_until(finite) is a hard error."

    render: @scene {
      sdk.Header(id = "s3-hdr", title = "STEPPABLEENGINE", caption = "single worker, no router", x = 48.6, y = 43.2, width = 1792.8, height = 118.8, surfaceRole = theme(surface.primary), inkRole = theme(ink.secondary))
      sdk.Panel(id = "s3-caller", title = "caller", detail = "owns clock", x = 54, y = 259.2, width = 351, height = 172.8, surfaceRole = theme(surface.elevated), strokeRole = theme(accent.primary))
      sdk.Edge(id = "s3-a1", mode = "connector", from = { nodeId: "s3-caller", anchor: "e" }, to = { nodeId: "s3-eng", anchor: "w" }, style = { stroke: theme(accent.primary), strokeWidth: 5.94, fill: "none" })
      sdk.Panel(id = "s3-eng", title = "SteppableEngine", detail = "now_ms + collector", x = 513, y = 259.2, width = 432, height = 172.8, surfaceRole = theme(surface.elevated), strokeRole = theme(accent.warning))
      sdk.Edge(id = "s3-a2", mode = "connector", from = { nodeId: "s3-eng", anchor: "e" }, to = { nodeId: "s3-worker", anchor: "w" }, style = { stroke: theme(accent.warning), strokeWidth: 5.94, fill: "none" })
      sdk.Panel(id = "s3-worker", title = "ReplayWorkerCore", detail = "execute_pass(collector, now_ms)", x = 1053, y = 259.2, width = 756, height = 172.8, surfaceRole = theme(surface.elevated), strokeRole = theme(accent.secondary))
      sdk.CodeBlock(
        id = "s3-code",
        text = "fn step() { let pass = worker.execute_pass(&mut collector, now_ms); now_ms = pass.end_ms; }",
        x = 81, y = 513, width = 891, height = 459,
        surfaceRole = theme(surface.elevated),
        strokeRole = theme(accent.primary)
      )
      sdk.PropertyList(
        id = "s3-table",
        title = "next_event_ms()",
        entries = [{ key: "worker.is_empty()", value: "None" }, { key: "holds any request", value: "Some(now_ms)" }],
        x = 1053, y = 513, width = 756, height = 226.8
      )
      sdk.Callout(
        id = "s3-callout",
        text = "step_until(finite) -> Err — cannot interrupt an in-flight pass",
        x = 1053, y = 777.6, width = 756, height = 189,
        strokeRole = theme(accent.warning)
      )

      timeline main {
        at 0 reveal s3-hdr duration 220
        after s3-hdr reveal s3-caller duration 220
        after s3-caller trace s3-a1 duration 300
        after s3-a1 reveal s3-eng duration 220
